e-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:\nbold\">, 2022</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:\n107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:\nbold\">.<o:p></o:p></span></u></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">(Online application is\navailable only during application period, which is from April 21<sup>st</sup> till\nJune 15<sup>th</sup>, 2022)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:\nitalic\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:\nitalic\">All required documents must be written either in English or Korean by\ncomputer typing.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Deja